# 1689. Partitioning Into Minimum Number Of Deci-Binary Numbers
# Leetcode Link: https://leetcode.com/problems/partitioning-into-minimum-number-of-deci-binary-numbers/description/
# Intuition : 
1️ Each deci-binary number contributes at most 1 per digit.
2️ So digit d needs at least d numbers stacked.
3️ Every digit position is independent.
4️ The largest digit dictates the minimum count.
5️ Therefore answer = maximum digit in n.

class Solution {
    public int minPartitions(String n) {
        int c=0;
        for(int i=0;i<n.length();i++){
            c=Math.max(c,n.charAt(i)-'0');
        }
        return c;
    }
}
